    <string name="sv_section_guard">Pre-send draft guard</string>
    <string name="sv_guard_note">One per line, Name: keyword or Name: /regex/. Use A &amp;&amp; B to warn only when both appear. A match shows a warning above the composer; it never stops you sending.</string>
    <string name="sv_guard_hint">Protected: a word you never send</string>
    <string name="sv_section_templates">Templates</string>
    <string name="sv_templates_note">Separate templates with a line holding only ---. First line is the title; add \" | category=booking_confirm favorite\" to group it on the quick-reply bar (categories: initial_info, screening_gate, verification_request, deflection, booking_confirm, reconfirm, follow_up). {alias}, {time_window} and {date} are filled from the client card or asked for. Inserting a template only fills the composer; import and export travel in the rules pack.</string>
