    <string name="sv_section_schedules">Schedule rules</string>
    <string name="sv_schedules_note">One rule per line: Name: days HH:MM-HH:MM categories action. Days: daily, weekdays, weekends, or mon,wed-fri. Categories: personal, professional, unknown, or all. Action: silent or held (alert lets it ring). Start a line with #off to keep it switched off. Precedence: codes and break-through keywords, then priority and personal, then thread mute, then focus, then quiet hours and schedules, then unknown senders and quiet keywords.</string>
